meta {
  name: 13 Verify Reported Apps
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/reported-app-assignments?device_id={{demoDeviceId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  device_id: {{demoDeviceId}}
}

docs {
  `GET /reported-app-assignments` — closes the loop: not what we *asked*
  the device to run, but what the device itself *reports* it is running
  (via `PUT /device/apps`).

  **Expect:** an entry with the current `application_config_id`
  (`{{appConfigId}}` after step 09).
}
